The original tomato and egg noodle soup doesn’t include soy sauce, but my mom’s secret recipe adds soy sauce and mushrooms, giving the soup a rich umami flavor that makes it taste amazing.
[end_timeline]
label scallions (scallions)
Tops it off with some scallions. Well done!
[signal arg="scallions_sprinkle"]
Tomato and egg noodle soup is my favorite dish from my mom’s cooking. It’s a simple, comforting meal that takes only about 20 minutes to make.
When I was little, my mom would cook it for me whenever she came home too late to prepare a big dinner.
Now that I’m away from home, it has become her “signature dish” — something she makes for me every time I visit. I’ve tried to recreate it myself, but it never tastes quite as authentic as when my mom makes it.
[signal arg="heartsauce_done"]
[end_timeline]